1
00:05:53,333 --> 00:05:59,333
Past Lives is a drama, romance film directed by Celine Song.

2
00:11:46,666 --> 00:11:52,666
After decades apart, childhood friends Nora and Hae Sung are reunited in New York for one fateful
weekend as they confront notions of destiny, love, and the choices that make a life.

3
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:46,000
Nora, played by Greta Lee.

4
00:23:33,333 --> 00:23:39,333
Hae Sung, played by Teo Yoo.

5
00:29:26,666 --> 00:29:32,666
Arthur, played by John Magaro.

6
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:26,000
Young Nora, played by Moon Seung-ah.

7
00:41:13,333 --> 00:41:19,333
Young Hae Sung, played by Yim Seung-min.

8
00:47:06,666 --> 00:47:12,666
Nora's Mom, played by Yoon Ji-hye.

9
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:06,000
Past Lives is a 2023 romantic drama film written and directed by
Celine Song in her feature directorial debut.

10
00:58:53,333 --> 00:58:59,333
Starring Greta Lee, Teo Yoo, and John Magaro, it follows two childhood friends over the course of 24 years while
they contemplate the nature of their relationship as they grow apart, living different lives.

11
01:04:46,666 --> 01:04:52,666
The plot is semi-autobiographical and inspired by real events from Song's life.

12
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:46,000
Past Lives premiered at the Sundance Film Festival on January 21, 2023, and was released by A24 in the United States on
June 2 and by CJ ENM in South Korea on a limited release on February 26, 2024, and a wide release on March 6.

13
01:16:33,333 --> 01:16:39,333
The film received critical acclaim and grossed $42.7 million worldwide.

14
01:22:26,666 --> 01:22:32,666
It was named one of the top ten films of 2023 by the National Board of Review and the American Film Institute, receiving multiple accolades, with five nominations at the
81st Golden Globe Awards including for Best Motion Picture - Drama and nominations at the 96th Academy Awards for Best Picture and Best Original Screenplay.

15
01:28:20,000 --> 01:28:26,000
Since its release, it has been included in lists of the
best films of the 2020s and the 21st century.

16
01:34:13,333 --> 01:34:19,333
The film explores themes of new york city, immigrant,
friendship, nostalgia, woman between two men.

17
01:40:06,666 --> 01:40:12,666
The tone is emotional.
